OL,3,GNEWSACall for #375k elected mayor
OL,4,Areferendum rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempt to force a referendum on
OL,7,Fwhether an elected mayor should be
OL,8,Fabolished has failed.
OL,10,FCouncillors in Bedford rejected a
OL,11,FLabour motion to let residents decide
OL,12,Fthe future of the role.
OL,14,FThey were told a referendum would cost
OL,15,F#375,000 to organise.
OL,17,FOpponents of the elected mayor system
OL,18,Fsaid the poll could still happen if
OL,19,Fenough residents signed a petition.
